  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MPA Phase III - Progest&#xe3;o Sergipe: Public Sector Management Efficiency&#xa0;Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve efficiency in public resource management in selected departments of the State of Sergipe.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The State of Sergipe has requested the World Bank&apos;s assistance to consolidate recent reforms and improve efficiency in whole-of-government public sector management systems and service delivery in sectors under the Progest&#xe3;o Program. The proposed scope for the project is fully aligned with the Multi-phased Programmatic Approach (MPA)  Progest&#xe3;o Program objectives. The State requested assistance in  the program cross-cutting areas, including human resource management; pensions; public procurement; public investment management and budgeting; and asset management. It will also support investments in financial management and information systems aiming at improving fiscal efficiency in the health, education and social assistance sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
